== Trivia ==
* In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', due to a typing error this item was called "Monster Manuel". This has been corrected for ''Rebirth''.
** {{dlc|r}} Monster Manual may sometimes display the misspelled name when picked up.
* Monster Manual is a direct reference to ''[[wikipedia:Dungeons & Dragons|Dungeons & Dragons]]''. Its appearance in the game closely resembles the ''Advanced Dungeons & Dragons First Edition Monster Manual''.
** {{dlc|r}} The item being in the Devil Room pool is likely a reference to the [https://www.nytimes.com/2016/04/18/us/when-dungeons-dragons-set-off-a-moral-panic.html moral panic surrounding the game in the 1980s.]

